{"sections":[{"slug":"极不连通空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"极不连通空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">极不连通空间</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"极不连通空间"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称满足如下等价条件的拓扑空间</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">极不连通空间</span></strong> (extremely disconnected space):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$S$ <span lang=\"zh\">中任意开集的闭包仍是开集</span>.</li>\n<li>$S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且对任意紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $T$, <span lang=\"zh\">任意满射</span> $T \\to S$ <span lang=\"zh\">都有截面</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">极不连通空间为紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投射对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}